      "id": "tldr--81a93294b48b",
      "canonicalPath": "windows/del.md",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "sourceLocale": "zh_TW",
      "name": "del",
      "title": "del",
      "summary": "刪除一個或多個檔案。 在 PowerShell 中，此命令為 `Remove-Item` 的別名。本頁的描述是基於命令提示字元 (`cmd`) 中的 `del`。",
      "platform": "windows",
      "softwareIds": [],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 8,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "查閱 PowerShell 的對應命令：",
          "command": "tldr remove-item",
          "line": 9,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L9"
        },
        {
          "description": "刪除一個或多個檔案 (可使用萬用字元)：",
          "command": "del {{檔案1 檔案2 ...}}",
          "line": 13,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L13"
        },
        {
          "description": "在刪除每個檔案之前提示確認：",
          "command": "del {{檔案}} /p",
          "line": 17,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L17"
        },
        {
          "description": "強制刪除唯讀檔案：",
          "command": "del {{檔案}} /f",
          "line": 21,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L21"
        },
        {
          "description": "遞歸刪除所有子目錄中的檔案：",
          "command": "del {{檔案}} /s",
          "line": 25,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L25"
        },
        {
          "description": "在使用全域萬用字元刪除檔案時不做提示確認：",
          "command": "del {{檔案}} /q",
          "line": 29,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L29"
        },
        {
          "description": "顯示幫助訊息和列出所有可用屬性：",
          "command": "del /?",
          "line": 33,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/windows/del.md#L33"
        },
        {
          "description": "刪除符合指定屬性的檔案：",
