    {
      "id": "tldr--8b8aa6427234",
      "canonicalPath": "common/awk.md",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "sourceLocale": "zh_TW",
      "name": "awk",
      "title": "awk",
      "summary": "用於處理檔案的多功能程式語言。 注意：各式 AWK 實作經常會將此命令作為指向其二進位檔的符號連結。 另請參閱：`gawk`。",
      "platform": "cross-platform",
      "softwareIds": [
        "awk--72559405",
        "gawk--3d177db2",
        "gow--4cb149e7"
      ],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 8,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "以空格為分隔符，列印檔案每行的第五欄：",
          "command": "awk '{print $5}' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 10,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L10"
        },
        {
          "description": "以空格為分隔符，列印檔案中所有包含「foo」之行的第二欄：",
          "command": "awk '/{{foo}}/ {print $2}' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 14,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L14"
        },
        {
          "description": "以逗號（而非空格）作為分隔符，列印檔案每一行的最後一欄：",
          "command": "awk -F ',' '{print $NF}' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 18,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L18"
        },
        {
          "description": "計算檔案中第一欄的數值總和並列印：",
          "command": "awk '{s+=$1} END {print s}' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 22,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L22"
        },
        {
          "description": "從第一行開始，每三行列印一行：",
          "command": "awk 'NR%3==1' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 26,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L26"
        },
        {
          "description": "根據條件列印不同的值：",
          "command": "awk '{if ($1 == \"foo\") print \"Exact match foo\"; else if ($1 ~ \"bar\") print \"Partial match bar\"; else print \"Baz\"}' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 30,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L30"
        },
        {
          "description": "列印第 10 欄中數值介於最小值與最大值之間的所有行：",
          "command": "awk '($10 >= {{最小值}} && $10 <= {{最大值}})' {{路徑/至/檔案}}",
          "line": 34,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L34"
        },
        {
          "description": "以冒號為分隔符，並以含有表頭且格式化的表格列印 UID 大於等於 1000 的使用者資訊（`%-20s`：靠左對齊的 20 個字串字元，`%6s`：靠右對齊的 6 個字串字元）：",
          "command": "awk 'BEGIN {FS=\":\";printf \"%-20s %6s %25s\\n\", \"Name\", \"UID\", \"Shell\"} $4 >= 1000 {printf \"%-20s %6d %25s\\n\", $1, $4, $7}' /etc/passwd",
          "line": 38,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md#L38"
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/awk.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "tldr--993d15d1ecfd",
      "canonicalPath": "common/aws.md",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "sourceLocale": "zh_TW",
      "name": "aws",
      "title": "aws",
      "summary": "Amazon Web Services 官方的命令列介面工具。 此命令也有關於其子命令的文件，例如：`s3`。",
      "platform": "cross-platform",
      "softwareIds": [
        "aws--dac27c03"
      ],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 8,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "設定 AWS 命令列：",
          "command": "aws configure wizard",
          "line": 9,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L9"
        },
        {
          "description": "使用 SSO 設定 AWS 命令列：",
          "command": "aws configure sso",
          "line": 13,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L13"
        },
        {
          "description": "取得呼叫者身分（用於排除權限問題）：",
          "command": "aws sts get-caller-identity",
          "line": 17,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L17"
        },
        {
          "description": "列出某個區域中的 AWS Dynamodb 並以 YAML 輸出：",
          "command": "aws dynamodb list-tables --region {{區域}} --output yaml",
          "line": 21,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L21"
        },
        {
          "description": "使用自動提示來幫助執行命令，：",
          "command": "aws iam create-user --cli-auto-prompt",
          "line": 25,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L25"
        },
        {
          "description": "取得 AWS 互動式精靈：",
          "command": "aws dynamodb wizard {{精靈名稱}}",
          "line": 29,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/aws.md#L29"
        },
        {
          "description": "產生 JSON CLI 骨架（對於基礎設施即程式碼有用）：",
